{"ref":"BDB, שָׂדַי","hw":"שָׂדַי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂדַי</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 96:12\" href=\"/Psalms.96.12\">ψ 96:12</a></sup> <strong>field, land (</strong>rare orig. form of <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂדֶה</span> (q.v. infr.), only poet.<strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.17\">Je 4:17</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂדָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:4\" href=\"/Hosea.10.4\">Ho 10:4</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  cultivated <em>field</em> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 12:12\" href=\"/Hosea.12.12\">12:12</a>, also <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:4\" href=\"/Hosea.10.4\">10:4</a> (si vera l., but v. Now), yielding food <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.13\">Dt 32:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:9\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.9\">La 4:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁמְרֵי שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.17\">Je 4:17</a> <em>keepers, watchmen, of a field</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  home of wild beasts: <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּהֵמוֹת שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 8:8\" href=\"/Psalms.8.8\">ψ 8:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:22\" href=\"/Joel.2.22\">Jo 2:22</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חַיְתוֹ שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 56:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.56.9\">Is 56:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:11\" href=\"/Psalms.104.11\">ψ 104:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">זִיז שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 50:11\" href=\"/Psalms.50.11\">50:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 80:14\" href=\"/Psalms.80.14\">80:14</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  plain, opp. mt., <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 18:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.18.14\">Je 18:14</a> (but dub., Co Du <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂרְיֹן</span>).<br><strong>4.</strong>  <em>land</em>, opp. sea, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 96:12\" href=\"/Psalms.96.12\">ψ 96:12</a> (cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שָׂדֶה</span> <strong>3</strong>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תֵּבֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 98:7\" href=\"/Psalms.98.7\">ψ 98:7</a>).","next":"BDB, שָׂדֶה","prev":"BDB, שׂדה"}